# Waterbender Ascension: "Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, put a quest counter on this enchantment. Then if it has four
# or more quest counters on it, draw a card." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with two Moxen and four Memnites (1/1, {0}). On turn 3 the four Memnites hit Bot2: four
# triggers, one per creature, and the counters go 1, 2, 3 with no card drawn and 4 with the first (the card is drawn after the counter is on, the "Then": a
